<title>USA: Pall Corp Q3 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Pall Corp Q3 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>EAST HILLS, N.Y. 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.18   profit	 $0.32</p>
<p> Net loss		  22,024   profit	40,598</p>
<p> Net sales		275,339		  277,376</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 126,684		  125,373</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHSEnded May 3, 1997 and Apr. 27, 1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.19		    $0.75</p>
<p> Net			 24,048		   94,214</p>
<p> Net sales		771,889		  762,701</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 126,027		  124,973</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: The company said in a written statement the third quarter $0.18 per share loss reflected one-time charges (including the Gelman Sciences merger and restructuring charges) of $92.01 million, or $0.47 a share (after pro forma tax effect).</p>
<p>Analysts consensus for the quarters' earnings per share were$0.32, according to First Call.</p>
